   "rationale": "Generalize the pairwise SID lemma to sets of simultaneously intervened nodes, handling the combinatorial union-of-parents adjustment needed for correctness. This would let the metric evaluate graph quality for policies that intervene on multiple variables at once.",
   "kind": "",
