   "rationale": "Since a single scalar SID collapses distinct error modes (identifiability failures, multi-intervention effects) into one number, design a multi-component distance that reports these facets separately rather than averaging them away. This directly builds on the hidden-variable and multi-intervention extensions as the component axes of the new metric.",
